      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "A tool used for\nwatering BERRIES\nand plants.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ruby-sapphire",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/5/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A tool used for\nwatering BERRIES\nand plants.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/6/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A nifty watering pail.\nUse it to promote strong growth in\nBERRIES planted in soft soil.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "firered-leafgreen",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/7/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "みずを　かける　どうぐ。\nつちに　うめた　きのみを\nすくすく　そだてる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "물을 주는 도구.\n땅에 심은 나무열매를\n쑥쑥 키운다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "澆水的器具。\n能讓埋在土壤裡的\n樹果快快長大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Sert à arroser les Baies plantées dans le sol.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Gießkanne. Gießt du mit ihr im Boden\nangepflanzte Beeren, wachsen sie schneller.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Regadera con forma de Wailmer. Muy útil para que\ncrezcan las bayas plantadas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Annaffiatoio a forma di Wailmer che aiuta a far\ncrescere rigogliose le piantine di bacche.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a tool for watering Berries you planted to\nmake them grow more quickly.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
